      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start, it sounds exactly like the character i have in mind. keep going with it. make it even more intense—really lean into the idea that without his specific intellect and his refusal to compromise, the whole movement would have just collapsed into aimless violence. emphasize that he was the actual architect of the era, not just a participant.",
